{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a050d867fe068e0ffb1be3226a476faf788cfcd7432227bf33aab74407a63711", "ja": "（雑誌のピンナップ撮影中。『バレンタイン特集』の\n写真を撮っているが、ここまで順調に進んでいる）", "zh": "（正在进行杂志的海报拍摄。虽然拍的是“情人节特辑”的照片，\n但到目前为止进展得很顺利）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "d1e3acc417e0463b14dd1b3a90ad9dd9a69b6ec447bfd0400ae791d3c598445c", "ja": "{$P$}！　ちゃんと見ててくれた？\n今日のワタシ、大人っぽく見えるでショ！？", "zh": "{$P$}！　有好好看着我吗？\n今天的我，看起来很成熟对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1002_p", "source_sha256": "32831344d2850d794e966c2897580bae0fb57e51a6a7544c4661e9b950ebc103", "ja": "お疲れ様、エレナ。\n服と部屋の雰囲気がピッタリで、すごくいいと思うよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，艾蕾娜。\n服装和房间的氛围非常搭，我觉得特别好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "49fcdc32b504394961339ff99f263588b970a95ae04368d2c5dce7376062b375", "ja": "エヘヘ♪　だからネ、いっぱい褒めてほしい……\nああ！？　やっぱり今のナシ！", "zh": "诶嘿嘿♪　所以呢，想让你多夸夸我……\n啊！？　刚才那句不算！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1004_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "4d454a077e56b75917f45b4be945d333b660942f58a58c5ded71d5fd1439adfb", "ja": "ううっ、忘れてたヨ～。今日は\n{$P$}と話さないって決めたのに～！", "zh": "呜呜，我给忘啦～。明明\n决定了今天不跟{$P$}说话的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0f65c60814b7203008ff71f03229fa4e72e35bc5cd684ca8d42f322d59528a59", "ja": "えっ……？\n話さないって……どういうことだ？", "zh": "咦……？\n你说不和我说话……是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "ed7831580df331894fa1d430fd092d759de1ec18726ed3df0dd036678c36b4cc", "ja": "それはネ……ハッ！　だ、だから話しちゃ\nダメなんだってば～。うう、ごめんネ？", "zh": "那个嘛……啊！所、所以才说不能说嘛～。呜呜，对不起哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a9003859995ab3e93b00a2d52a4167425454129eca74b96c5a9cbb9e585f8b5f", "ja": "そんな……。\nエレナと話すの楽しいのに……はあ～。悲しいなぁ。", "zh": "怎么会……。\n明明和艾琳娜聊天很开心的……唉～好难过啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "54dd3dd7a4b5bdf2c3a10400ca0821df2fa16c5696028f6023f1a90695cea5d2", "ja": "エッ！？\n{$P$}……ち、違うノ～！", "zh": "诶！？\n{$P$}……不、不是那样啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "da9e5c73c48f53ea6d2647ebfe2ed7fb8dbc1d7cd47ade6f99af3febcd2cbf35", "ja": "{$P$}はゼンゼン悪くなくて……\nこれは、ワタシの問題なんだヨ～！", "zh": "{$P$}完全没有错……\n这是我自己的问题啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d7bc5423cc9f884f9b493f869cd69dcf2de01fe2961ae14304e73c0975fa291c", "ja": "ん？　エレナの問題？", "zh": "嗯？艾莲娜自己的问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "3aa204a8c9b946ff799af600fdacea573931d132eced0ded57997a40c75a5699", "ja": "ウン……。だって、{$P$}に\n褒められたら……絶対、気が抜けちゃうんだもん。", "zh": "嗯……因为要是被{$P$}夸奖了……肯定会放松下来的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "0b25638f3bf6fe86a3de7eeac0aaf5da75d16167957b77a6d6f5db456f9cfb04", "ja": "今日は、大人っぽいワタシでいないと♪\nだからお話しは撮影のあとに……ん～～～！", "zh": "今天得保持成熟一点的我才行♪  \n所以，聊天要等拍摄结束后……嗯～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "4c9c21e5323aff286be7d18e2dac064c4195c76b104a48c3051a08e9eb3aeeed", "ja": "やっぱり、そんなのムリだヨ～！\n上手に出来たら、いっぱい褒めて欲しいもん……！", "zh": "果然还是做不到啦～！\n要是我表现得很好，希望你能好好夸奖我嘛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e255cf87564ba1bd1d0b7a9852a4dd2688dc8ea6a752a1fcfbd4ba4cb89c94b3", "ja": "あははっ……。\nエレナなりに、撮影のために頑張ってたんだな。", "zh": "啊哈哈……\n原来艾莲娜也是在用自己的方式，为了拍摄而努力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1016_p", "source_sha256": "87e77805b1b4f3d26c8a1d936ea6c036267a1cc2281205d63ecdb5c0a32cea94", "ja": "わかった。撮影の邪魔はしたくないし、\n終わるまで話しかけないようにするよ。", "zh": "我知道了。我也不想妨碍拍摄，\n在结束之前就尽量不去跟你搭话吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "dc0fb864ac6a4b2bd3c5132c4028fbb8927080d2c77a54049058477a814e5b5d", "ja": "エッ！？　それはそれで、寂しいヨ～……。\nワタシが言ったことなんだけど……ン～……。", "zh": "诶！？那样的话，我也会寂寞的呀～……\n虽然这话是我自己说的……嗯～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1018_p", "source_sha256": "48c11d59a3e6d77d60faedb469eb7de4628ded22b42ceb8f44fdc1c94b685020", "ja": "まあまあ。撮影中に言えない分、\nいっぱい褒め言葉を考えておくから。", "zh": "好了好了。拍摄时没法夸你的份，\n我会多想些赞美的话留着说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "3b34d5ea3984c81d5a211bba5b96e53a049fb8ee32739363e4970814326761c2", "ja": "ホント……？\nワタシが、もういいよって言うまで褒めてくれる？", "zh": "真的……？\n你会一直夸我，直到我说“够了”为止吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5ccb4feb1bd7e31dc59350dff1b1774ab2fa41845cbc423a92aef9906cafb884", "ja": "ああ！　今日のエレナは絶好調だから、褒めるところは\n沢山……おっと、これは後に取っておかなきゃな。", "zh": "当然！今天的艾琳娜状态绝佳，可以夸的地方多着呢……哦，这个得留到以后再说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "e90c3697960488762e720e0cca0d4da262ece047ea2a3b3486413abb886d1585", "ja": "ワオ！　ありがとう{$P$}！\nワタシ、なんだか踊りたい気分だヨ……！", "zh": "哇！谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我，不知怎么的，好想跳舞哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "ca3ea2f768f88cb079614332bf9fc45ddebf60e7dd0b4644c1e4df7c212cf892", "ja": "って、ダメダメ！\n撮影が終わるまで、大人っぽくしないと……。", "zh": "不行不行！  \n在拍摄结束前，得表现得成熟一点才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0604_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "d118e183e7a6891411c4c6a8d1becad53cb6b848c606b448a0c3cc03e9e99db7", "ja": "{$P$}、約束だヨ？\nあとでいーっぱい、ハッピーな気持ちにさせてネ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，约好了哦？\n之后要让人感受到满满的幸福心情哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
